  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A stencil airbrush painting of a symmetrical totem figure with a feathered headdress, in hot pink, orange and yellow on white paper.",
    "description": "A square stencil airbrush painting on white paper. The same frontal totem figure as the other Totem pieces, rendered in bubblegum pink gradients with orange, crimson and lemon yellow patches inside the cells. Thin white gaps separate every cell.",
